window.products.push({"id":785023,"name":"Polar Whale 5 pc Drawer Organizer Set (Compatible with Ikea Alex) Tray Waterproof for Office Home Dorm 11.5x14.5 Inches Spacious Compartments Black Ex","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":95.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZImA5K76L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Complete 5-Piece Solution! Control the chaos in your home, bedroom, dorm or office drawer with the premium Polar Whale Drawer Organizer 5-Piece Set. Includes 5 black high density foam drawer organizers (with various extra deep compartments). IMPORTANT: includes foam inserts only (drawers and cabinet not included). Make optimal use of your precious drawer storage space, and keep your frequently used items neat, organized and all within easy reach. Designed to be specifically compatible with IKEA Alex drawers (2 shorter and 3 taller inserts), but organizers also fit many standard drawers (before ordering, please make sure your drawer's inner dimensions are larger than 11.5\" x 14.5\" x 2\" tall for the shallow drawers and larger than 11.5\" x 14.5\" x 4.2\" tall for the deep drawers). Organizer set is ideal for the dorm, home, office, kitchen, workshop, garage, bathroom, bedroom, basement, hobby/craft room and more! Made from elegant lightweight yet durable high density waterproof black foam material. These beautiful organizers are non-slip, anti-rattle and super-easy to clean (rinse it off, or wash it in the top rack of your dishwasher). 3 of the organizers measure approximately 11.5\" x 14.5\" x 4.2\", 2 of the organizers measure approximately 11.5\" x 14.5\" x 2\". IMPORTANT: includes foam inserts only (drawers and cabinet not included).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZImA5K76L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Polar Whale","source_asin":"B07Q6ZBW1L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-785023","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Q6ZBW1L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Q6ZBW1L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":785024,"name":"Comfort Zone CZTF320WT 31” 3-Speed Oscillating Tower Fan with Convenient Top-Mounted Controls, Perfect for Office, Desk or Dorm Room, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GpaMcPJjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This Comfort Zone 31 in. 3-speed oscillating tower fan can distribute a steady, consistent breeze for instant relief on warm days. Equipped with a wide oscillation feature and an ergonomic, easy-to-use control knob, this 3-speed tower fan rotates creating additional airflow, helping you to reduce the impact of humidity in a large room or provide fresh air to your space. With three powerful output speeds to choose from, the low setting is great for circulating air in a stuffy room, while the high setting can generate a powerful breeze to combat the heat. Mounted to a large base, this quiet powerful fan is exceptionally stable, helping to prevent it from being knocked-over by children or pets who bump into it. The sleek, slim line design of this tower fan, will not only blend into the room, but it also makes storage simple and easy when the fan is not in use. This quiet fan is the ideal choice for home offices and public work spaces where loud noises may interrupt daily work. It is also suitable for in your bedroom, as the quiet motor will not disrupt your sleep cycle.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GpaMcPJjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Comfort Zone","source_asin":"B08ZV6PWHT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-785024","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ZV6PWHT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ZV6PWHT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
