window.products.push({"id":785078,"name":"Emile Henry Couleurs 5-Piece Lion's Head Soup Tureen Set, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41MQ1ZMM32L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Marcigny, a small town nestling between the hills of Southern Burgundy, has been home to Emile Henry for the past 150 years. Faithful to its origins, the entire production is carried out here. Thanks to its clay, rich in refractory properties, Burgundy has remained a fertile area for potters, passing on their savoir-faire from generation to generation. Clay, a natural and noble material, has been used since the mists of the time to cook or preserve food. While respecting the traditional techniques, Emile Henry has introduced technological improvements (Ceradon ®) so that the dishes are more resistant to mechanical and thermal shock. Strong, durable, all Emile Henry pieces can be taken directly from the freezer to the hot oven, can go under a broiler and is microwave, freezer and dishwasher safe. The natural clay is unsurpassed for conducting and retaining heat. All pieces are perfect for everyday use and carry a 3 year warranty against defects. Amazon.com Over 150 years of experience have made the potters at Emile Henry expert at producing tableware that is as lovely as it is useful. Ever since 1850, Emile Henry has been producing ceramics in the Burgundy region of France from a clay of superior quality that holds up amazingly well to a wide range of temperatures. In addition, the company has developed patented technological improvements to increase the durability and strength of its tableware and bakeware. The Emile Henry 5-piece Couleurs Lion's Head soup tureen set contains four 5- by 3-1/2-inch, 2-cup soup bowls and one 9-1/2- by 6-1/2-inch, 4-quart soup tureen; the tureen has a lid with a small cutout for a ladle handle. Because the bowls are safe for use under a broiler or in a microwave, they are perfectly suited for melting cheese on dishes like the classic French Onion Soup Gratinee. The tureen will keep hot soup from cooling off too quickly; and it looks great on the table. Emile Henry tableware is chip-resistant, sturdy, and lovely. The beauty of Emile Henry's design is its simplicity; the tureen and bowls are solid-colored with Grecian-urn curves and little ornamentation besides the lion's heads. But the high-gloss glaze and clean, primary Couleurs colors are anything but plain. Glazed in a crisp, modern color palette, these bowls can serve equally well in casual settings for everyday use or for more elegant tables on holidays and special occasions. Additional matching pieces in the Couleurs style include various bowls, place settings, and serving pieces such as an oval platter, a pitcher, and covered butter dish. Emile Henry pieces are dishwasher-safe, so they're easy to clean. The company offers a three-year warranty against defects. --Garland Withers What's in the Box Soup tureen set consists of: four 5-inch, 2-cup soup bowls and one 9-1/2-inch, 4-quart lidded soup tureen. 5 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41MQ1ZMM32L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Emile Henry","source_asin":"B00028J1T6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-785078","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00028J1T6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00028J1T6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":785079,"name":"A2Z Rug Traditional Caen Collection Rugs Teal 10' x 13' -Feet Area Rug","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91XOQotqVnL._AC_SL1392_.jpg","description":"Polypropylene Contains colors: Teal, Beige, Gray - The size of this rug is: 10' x 13' -Feet This finest quality collection is manufactured with the latest technology Belgium model rapier carpet weaving looms, Made of Polypropylene, Rug Thickness is 1/4'' , with the super quality and handling - Perfect for living room rug, Dining Room Rug - Bedroom Area Rug Perfect for any room, Home decor floor and carpet, Great value, high quality, and very durable. Care instructions: Vacuum regularly and spot clean. This rug is stain resistant, fade resistant, no shedding, and easy to clean For more design and sizes you can click on ( A2Z Rug ) on top of this listing and you will have more choose. We are always accurate in our descriptions and 100% confident in our products which is why we offer completely FREE returns.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91XOQotqVnL._AC_SL1392_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"A2Z Rug","source_asin":"B06Y69NBSZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-785079","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06Y69NBSZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06Y69NBSZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":785080,"name":"Kerazo K&K Keramik German Made Fermenting Crock Pot, F2, 10 L/2.6 gal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":172.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41vm12wuTPL._AC_.jpg","description":"Through the years, sauerkraut has been recognized as one of the healthiest foods, and was even used on sailing ships to protect sailors from scurvy. Natural lactic acid fermentation is one of the oldest and healthiest means of food preservation. It allows natural, beneficial bacteria to perform a fermentation process in which vegetables develop a pleasantly sour taste and remain rich in vitamins and minerals. Lactic acid fermentation is the only method of preservation that retains all the natural plant ingredients while improving the quality, taste and aroma. Premium quality keramik German made fermenting crock pot is designed in the 100 year old traditional tubular shape with side handles and come complete with pot, lid, weighing stones, and recipe book. It is easy to transport and lift, the fermentation cooker 10 liter, with the handles on both sides. Keep natural nutrition-packed in sauerkraut and pickled vegetables with free of lead and cadmium fermentation crock the key feature of this keramik crock is that deep gully allows expelling of gas and prevents entry of insects, dust and air. It is one of the most high quality and safe keramik pot which is fired at 1260 c. The sauerkraut crock pot comes with thick base and wall which makes it stable and durable. K&k keramik is well known for a variety of beautiful hand-made pottery and rum pots. K&k also makes gartopf fermenting crocks with the same high quality standards and beauty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41vm12wuTPL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Samson Brands","source_asin":"B00KADU3NG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-785080","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KADU3NG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KADU3NG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
