window.products.push({"id":785125,"name":"Chestnut Collection 7pc Comforter Set - Queen Size - Chocolate Brown Color","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/916cYYCndsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Elegance and style combined... Complete your bedroom decor with this luxurious 7pc comforter set. This bedding ensemble featrues a classic design and is finished with matching cord. Set includes: 1 Comforter, 2 Pillow Shams, 1 Bed Skirt, 2 Cushions, 1 Neck Roll Pillow.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/916cYYCndsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chestnut Collection","source_asin":"B007ZHPDCQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-785125","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007ZHPDCQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007ZHPDCQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":785126,"name":"Parade of Red Trees II Artwork by Rio, 24 by 47-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":65.67,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XKJRd22FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a row of trees with red leaves. Masters Fine Art is a company that travels around the world to bring the best in fine art from outstanding artists from different lands. They believe that art is the soul of the world, that it represents our human essence. MFA works mostly with Latin American art. It portrays a happy view of life, represented with bright beautiful colors, music, dance, love, hope and happiness, giving us the feeling that we can overcome all hardships with all the beautiful things we still have in life. The art Masters Fine Art carries is many things: colorful, contemporary, sexy, emotional, musical, romantic. Above all it is beautiful and full of joy. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XKJRd22FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00IWSL06U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-785126","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00IWSL06U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00IWSL06U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":785127,"name":"Modern Village Small Woven Storage Basket, 12 Inch Round Fruit Basket (Sage Green)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.4,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OW7jOHZ3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Modern Village Small Woven Basket and Organizer - Sage Green Refresh your home decor with a modern, hand-woven display bowl. Made from dyed seagrass, a fibrous plant that is found in tropical oceans, this basket-style bowl is both charming and functional. Ideal for displaying fresh fruit in your kitchen, accenting a coffee table, or giving your bathroom a relaxed, beachy feel. The bowl measures 12 inches across, 4 inches at its base and is 5 inches deep. Highly versatile, this light, woven basket can store a variety of items for an inviting display: toiletries and hand towels, keys and phone chargers, fruit, cookies, and even bread. This bowl can also be used as an alternative to wicker gift baskets which are incredibly rigid. The bowls soft design can brilliantly hold gifts and be displayed and reused after! The bowlâs fiber is golden yellow which is interwoven with sage green plastic accents for a pop of color. The color contrast makes for an subtle touch of modern of your living space. Let your imagination run wild. What is seagrass? Surprisingly, seagrass is not actually grass, but a name for a variety of flowering plants that grows in both salt and fresh water. Seagrasses are most common in the tropics around all major continents. Seagrass is found in vast underwater meadows that are an important habitat for marine life. Our seagrass is hand picked on a small scale by coastal villages, ensuring a sustainable and renewable harvest. Measures 12 inches in diameter, 5 inches tall and is 4 inches wide at the base / bottom.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OW7jOHZ3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MODERN VILLAGE","source_asin":"B088PBF6TG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-785127","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088PBF6TG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088PBF6TG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":785128,"name":"Alox Meal Food Storage Retort Pouch - Airtight Bags Packaging Storing Smell Proof Long Term Storage Heat Seal Easy Tear BPA Free (White / Alox 9pcs / ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XJlGoVHfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This pouch is a composite material food pouch that can withstand the retort process at 257°F (125 ℃) for 30 minutes. It is a functional pouch that uses a high-blocking film to meet high-barrier quality, which extends the shelf life of existing packaging, and also makes it easier to cook in a microwave oven than aluminum packaging. [Material Handling]: Reduced packaged weight and dimensions eliminate heavy, bulky cans/jars during handling/waste easy to handle, ship, store, use and dispose of. Bulk waste is reduced, making clean up and disposal a fraction of the space and processing taken up by traditional cans, glass jars, or semi-rigid thermoformed containers. [Convenient]: Consumers find pouches easy to handle, store, and dispose of, as well as retort pouches are easy to open versus needing to puncture metal or require additional tools. Also there is a U shape tear on the side for easy tear, save time to find a knife or scissors. [Heat Sealable]: The open top of bags can be vacuum sealed and also be heat sealed, so the airtight bags keep the foods and packaging content fresh for a long time. These Retort Pouches can reseal after opening. [How to Use]: 1) Use a funnel to fill the pouch with the content * Be careful not to get foreign substances on sealing part 2) Seal the opening part of the pouch with appropriate heat and pressure. * Use a sealing machine that can supports up to 240 to 320 microns thick. The pouch is made of mixed material, such as Alox PET, Nylon and CPP.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XJlGoVHfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LUCIR","source_asin":"B09GY7QHD5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-785128","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09GY7QHD5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09GY7QHD5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
