window.products.push({"id":785192,"name":"Milk Frother, Electric Milk Frother and Steamer, OTWEN Automatic Hot Cold Milk Foamer, 4 Modes Stainless Steel Quiet High Capacity Milk Warmer for Cof","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GC9POeo4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☕【4 Settings, Frothing & Heating】 OTWEN electric milk frother can create hot thick / thin milk froth, warm milk and cold milk froth. It is ideal milk steamer for coffee lovers. You know your taste best, with our milk foamer frother, you can make luscious foam for your iced americano, cappuccino, matcha at home anytime without going out. With OTWEN milk warmer, make coffee for yourself or heat milk for family and enjoy a new day. 🍹【Quick foaming, Delicate Froth】 150W milk frother electric can complete the delicate milk froth in 1-2 minutes, and heat the milk in 3 minutes. Just press the button to make luscious foam for hot macchiato, hot chocolate or ice coffee at any time at home, and share the deliciousness and leisure with family/friends. 💖Note: Please use whole milk. (Fat content>3 %) 🥛【Large Capacity, Simple Operation】 The large capacity of milk frother can save time for you to make 2 or more cups of coffee foam. Allow you to add up to 150ml(5.07oz) milk for frothing and up to 300ml(10.14oz) milk to heat at one time. The operation of milk steamer is simple, after installing the frothing paddle, firstly press \"FUNCTION\", secondly select the mode you want, and finally press \"ON/OFF\". 💖Note: Please don't fill milk over the max limit of every function. 🍪【Non-stick Interior, Effortless Cleaning】 The inside of the milk frother is made of high-quality non-stick layer material, there will be no dirt on the bottom even if it is used frequently. It can be cleaned in a few seconds effortlessly: Rinse with water, wipe it with a towel and it will be as perfect as new. High-quality OTWEN stainless steel milk frother is durable and anti-rust which ensures it is long lasting. 🍨【Quiet & Secure, Temperature Control】 OTWEN Milk frother steamer is ETL-listed and adopt temperature control system, it will automatically shut off when the milk foam is done, which is very safe. Free your hands, no need to wait by side. The milk frother runs very quietly, no annoying sounds to disturb family. Note: the Rated voltage is 120 V.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GC9POeo4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OTWEN","source_asin":"B092H9TBHN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-785192","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092H9TBHN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092H9TBHN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
