window.products.push({"id":785298,"name":"Rossbright - Pasta Noodle Drying Rack Complete with Stainless Steel Double Headed Fluted Wheel Pasta Cutter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61AU0cuLfCS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Rossbright Pasta Drying Rack - Durable Noodle Drying Stand The days are gone that your pasta sticks to each other or counters. The stand was designed to make life simpler by keeping your freshly made pasta separate. By creating authentic Italian dishes in your own kitchen you can impress friends and family. Use the Rossbright Pasta Drying Rack to dry the variety of pasta you make by using the provided cutting wheel like spaghetti, linguine, tagliatelle, lasagna, and fettuccine. Practical and Easy to Use With No screws or tools needed. Simple and easy to use. Simply lift the pasta drying arms up to 90 degrees and insert the arms into the slots. Easily pull down the legs and insert them into position. Easy to clean with a damp cloth or rinse it in warm soapy water and let it dry. The drying rack folds up flat, saving space on counters or the pantry. The folded size is 8.6 inches in height and 3.5 inches in width. Durable and Food Safe The foldable Pasta Drying Rack is made from Food Safe ABS material with a stainless steel middle support pole for added strength and durability . The holder has 10 Hanging Arms and each arm can carry a total of 1 lb (0.45 kg) of freshly made noodles. Included in the Box We have an all-in-one package for your convenience. Profession Gauge Stainless steel Pastry wheel, sometimes called pastry cutter, makes cutting shapes fast and easy. Measures: 7\" x 3\" x .5\" / 18cm x 7.5cm x 1.25cm So many possibilities Making homemade ravioli will be a snap with the ravioli cutter wheel. Double-headed fluted wheel for scalloped edge and straight cut with flat wheel. Ideal for pasta, pastry or cookie dough, create beautiful lattice crusts and decorative cuts for pies, pastries and ravioli. What's Included? - 1 x Rossbright Pasta Drying Rack - 1 x Stainless Steel Ravioli/Pastry Wheel - 1 x Rossbright Pasta Drying Rack - 1 x Stainless Steel Ravioli/Pastry Wheel","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61AU0cuLfCS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ROSSBRIGHT","source_asin":"B08VJJW3CG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-785298","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08VJJW3CG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08VJJW3CG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
