window.products.push({"id":785346,"name":"Haussmann® Original Wood Twist Stool 12 X 12 X 23 in High Grey Oil","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pq4-b+YPL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Need a unique functional one of a kind accent table that doubles as a stool? Nature’s creations are always in style; this dramatic accent piece is a stylish complement to both traditional and contemporary settings The Original Twist Stool Design, Hand-carved and completely eco-friendly is this Twist Stool at 12 inches square by 23 inches high. The beauty of this design lies in its simplicity. It’s bold, yet gentle, rustic yet refined. One quarter twists support this elegant piece, which can serve as an end table, display stand, or stool for last minute seating. Nature’s creations are always in style; this dramatic accent piece is a stylish complement to both traditional and contemporary settings. Grey - Antiqued Grey-White finish oil makes the wood turn to an antique white look with a grey patina finish. The light portions of wood turn to shades of beige, and the dark wood lightens to shades of brown finish that is water resistant and easy to maintain *Please Note* There will be various separations or cracks and color will vary from the pictures depicted for every single piece. No two pieces will match *YOU WILL NOT RECEIVE THE PIECE PICTURED. AS THAT IS JUST A REPRESENTATION OF THE DESIGN AND FINISH TONE. There will be visible marks from carving, patches from repairs, knot holes, natural inclusions, and worm holes. There will be various separations or cracks on your piece when it arrives. They naturally occurred as the wood was dried. Over time, continued shrinkage will accentuate existing separations or generate new ones. This does not compromise the structural performance or integrity of the wood and is considered inherent to the natural beauty of the design.The handcrafted touch of artisan skill creates variations in color, size and design. Color discrepancies will occur between the product and your computer screen Hand made from start to finish. 100% Sustainable eco friendly woods and finishes Each piece hand carved from a solid piece of sustainable wood. Craftspeople from the Chiang Mai area in Northern Thailand create these one-of-a-kind pieces with the simplest of tools. Each piece is a unique creation, more than a piece of furniture…it is a Work of Art Only listed product included","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pq4-b+YPL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Haussmann","source_asin":"B00X3L1MA0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-785346","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00X3L1MA0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00X3L1MA0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
