window.products.push({"id":785387,"name":"FASTNOVA 11x14 inch White Real Solid Wood Picture Photo Poster Print Art Frame Made to Display Picture 8x12 with Mat or 11x14 Without Mat, Wall Mounti","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617akEhu5pL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"1. The two sides of acrylic sheet are covered with protective film, Please all torn off when use! 2. Wall Mounting Material Included: Black S hook and White non-trace nail . 3. The black S hook : It has been installed on the back of the picture frame. When Hanging the picture frame. Break open the sawtooth iron of the balck S hook to 45 degrees with your hand , to be able to hook the protruding tail of the white non-trace nail conveniently. 4. The white non-trace nail : It is in the extra small plastic bag. It has three thin needles and one protuberant tail. The needle must point to the metope, pay attention to direction and safety . The three thin needles were nailed to the wall without a trace, which was easy and firm. The protruding tail is used to hook the black S hook on the back of the picture frame, conveniently and quickly. 5.The frame is 2 cm Wide 2 cm Thick, 12 x 15 inch is the outside dimension of the photo frame, not the dimension of the photo. 6. 11 x 14 inch is the dimension of the photo that can be displayed without mat. Photos that are larger than or less than 11 x 14 inch can not be used without mat on the print frame. 7. Because the dimension of the accurate opening of the mat is (7+3/8) x (11+3/8), the display dimension of any size picture on the poster frame is (7+3/8) x (11+3/8), which is about 8 x 12. So 8 x 12 inch is the minimum dimension of the photo that can be displayed with mat. 8. The unmarked nail can not be used on hard walls such as tile and marble.if you want to use, please use electric drill and screw. 9. Can be used for matting photos, art, and needlepoint. 10. Great for crafts, backboards, signs, children's projects, company and school projects. 11. Good art frames Solutions at gallery. 12. Have 3-5 mm size measurement error, please careful purchase if particularly mind.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617akEhu5pL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FASTNOVA","source_asin":"B01M4NYWR1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-785387","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M4NYWR1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M4NYWR1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
