window.products.push({"id":785434,"name":"Oil Sprayer for Cooking-Spray Evenly and Effortlessly-Non-Aerosol-Fall Resistant,350ml Large Capacity Oil Dispenser Mister Refillable Oil Sprayer Bott","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CWmZEUFOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【High-quality Materials】: The cooking injector is made of food-grade plastic and does not contain BPA. The material is light and strong, so there is no need to worry about breaking like a glass bottle. Moreover, the intelligent design of transparent and durable material makes it easy to know the status and amount of oil, and it is easy to quickly identify the seasoning (oil/vinegar/sauce). The ergonomically designed non-slip push handle makes it easier to use. 【Large Capacity】: 350ml capacity, filled up at one time, can be used for a long time. Equipped with a foldable funnel, the soft silicone funnel allows you to inject olive oil more conveniently. Compared with the 100ml glass spray bottle, it is more portable and more convenient to use. Can be used in the kitchen or taken outdoors. And easy to carry to any place you want. 【Excellent Spraying Effect】: Compared with other spray bottles on the market, it is a spray bottle that can actually atomize oil. Olive oil will be sprayed evenly and widely on the food and will not drip or spray like a water column. The atomization effect will be affected by the distance and consistency of the added liquid. The best way to spray is to hold the sprayer at 45 degrees. 【Two Spray Modes】: Fan spray or flow spray. You can change the spray mode by twisting the nozzle as needed. The reusable fuel injector is a good helper in the kitchen and can be used for barbecue, salad, baking, frying, etc. You can freely use your imagination to use the fuel injector, the multi-function fuel injection bottle can meet your various needs. 【Healthy Diet】: The olive oil spray fuel injector produces a uniform and pure oil mist. You can easily control the olive oil intake of you and your family, reduce calories and protect your health. Efficient use, no waste. Improve taste and healthier. Fuel injectors are great gifts for mothers, chefs, health-conscious people and food lovers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CWmZEUFOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZUDKSUY","source_asin":"B092M8F4CZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-785434","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092M8F4CZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092M8F4CZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
