window.products.push({"id":785474,"name":"VOKOVO 24oz Glass Tumbler with Bamboo Lid and Straw, Glass Water Bottles with Time Marker, Iced Coffee Cup with Handle, Two Straw - Boba Straw & Drink","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uNqoRwtHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SCIENTIFIC HANDLE DESIGN- VOKOVO reusable coffee cups have ergonomic handle, so you can easily hold the cup, no matter if the cup is cold or hot, you can use the handle to avoid irritation of your hands. The glass water bottle with handle is better to hold and it is not easy to slip from the hand, which is loved by most people. NATURAL BAMBOO LID & RESISTANT TO LEAK- The lid of this coffee tumbler is made of pure natural bamboo. It’s very environmentally friendly and non-hazardous. Note: After using the drinking glasses, pay attention to cleaning the lid. Each smoothie cup is equipped with a detachable silicone ring that can be adjustable and stop the water from leaking out. GLASS WATER BOTTLES WITH TIMES TO DRINK & 2 STRAW- VOKOVO travel coffee mug with time marker preserves the purity of water. This is a very handy way to keep up with water intake,stay hydrated and healthy. -Two straws: boba straw and slim straw.Removable straw makes drinking more convenient. MULTI-FUNCTION- These multiple-uses glass cups can be used for iced smoothie, dry-hopped brew, traditional cocktails, cold beverages, soda, morning coffee, iced water. Great for Parties or Everyday Use -These tumblers are the perfect glasses for parties, holidays, barbecues, picnics, bachelor and bachelorette parties, weddings and more! They also make a great gift for anyone who loves fun drinks. DISHWASHER SAFE- The tumbler glass silicone sleeve is food grade. Different colors make the water bottle a lot easier to be identified. This reusable water bottle with lids and straws is made of high quality, crystal clear, 100% BPA free, toxic-free, lead free glass to ensure food grade safety. Can go right in your dishwasher. Contact our customer service if you have any questions with our products and we will respond you as soon as possible.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uNqoRwtHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VOKOVO","source_asin":"B0BN1MKK3N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-785474","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BN1MKK3N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BN1MKK3N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
