window.products.push({"id":785511,"name":"Deluxe Camping Girl Birthday Party Bundle Includes 20 each of Invitations & Thank You Cards with Envelopes + 2 Different Sizes of Stickers, Mini Candy","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61A24EvFqmL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"*** Bigger... Better... and Best of All... Cuter. Presenting Deluxe Camping Girl Birthday Party Bundle. Designed by a Mom for Moms. Complete party pack includes 20 each of invitations and thank you cards (both with envelopes), 2” circle party favor stickers, kiss sticker labels, mini chocolate candy bar wrappers, and water bottle wrap-around labels *** *2-sided printing on both invitations and thank you cards for that added pop of color & extra touch of quality *Larger 5\"x7\" invitation size for bigger visual impact (most others are only 4\"x5.5\") *Heftier 80# cardstock with a smooth matte finish (so it's easier to write on) Includes matching thank you cards and 4 different types of party favor stickers too Hunting for just the right envelopes? Rest easy. Your 20 birthday postcards and thank you cards each come with 20 crisp white envelopes, perfectly sized to fit the cards exactly. What's more, you can count on these eye-popping invites for all-American craftsmanship: They're designed, printed & carefully hand-packaged right here in the USA. To top it off, the complete bundle is fully backed by Amazon's 30-Day Guarantee. OMG, They're the Absolute Cutest... So Add to Cart Right Away!! Why choose Party Supplies from Amanda Creation? *All products are custom designed by Amanda herself! *Amanda Creation has been in business since 2011 bringing unique party items to moms and children. *You won’t find designs like these anywhere else. Stand out with your celebrations and get the most creative and innovative party products instead of mass produced supplies. *We pay attention to the smallest details, because they are hand designed complete care is taken in making everything extra special to be the most beautiful coordinated party supplies you have ordered.  *We stand behind our product, if you are not completely satisfied for any reason just contact us to return for a full refund","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61A24EvFqmL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amanda Creation","source_asin":"B07P5CQN9S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-785511","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07P5CQN9S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07P5CQN9S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":785512,"name":"Urban Composter Cty Composter Bucket, 1.8 gallon, Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817Bt8cD8gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With stylish good looks and the same range of coloured lids, the Urban Composter City is the perfect companion for city dwelling. It is designed for smaller households or for people who eat out a lot. The compact size will fit easily on the counter top or under the sink.Available in your choice of coloured lid: Chilli, Berry, Lime or Black.The Urban Composter City uses anaerobic composting to ferment your kitchen scraps right in the bucket, with no foul odours and no flies. Capacity: 1.8 gallonsDimensions: 9 inches diameter, 10.5 inches highHow it worksThrow: Cut your scraps into small pieces are placed into the Urban Composter. All types of food scraps can be composted including: Meat, Fish, Vegetables, Fruit, Dairy, Coffee, Wilted Flowers (no bones or excessive liquids).Spray: Compost Accelerator spray is applied to the scraps. This organic spray breaks down and ferments the organic waste in the bucket, which and means no nasty odors during fermentation. The convenient spray bottle is easy to store and refill.Drain: During fermentation, juice is released which is saturated in good bacteria and nutrients. This can be drained every few days, diluted and added to your flower beds or gardens. It can also be flushed as it promotes septic systems. Mix: When mixed with soil, the remaining scraps will break down in about 6 weeks. Drain all liquid and add the pulp to soil. It can be buried in the garden, in a pot, or added to worm farms or outdoor compost heaps.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817Bt8cD8gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Urban Composter","source_asin":"B00XA2BTNC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-785512","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00XA2BTNC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00XA2BTNC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
