window.products.push({"id":785559,"name":"Jar Opener for Weak Hands - Jar Opener for Seniors with Arthritis, Rubber Grip Jar Opener 5 in 1 Bottle and Can Opener 4 in 1 Non Slip Jar Lid Opener ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PyTRH5YqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Must Have Kitchen Gadget: Eliminate rags, knives, banging, hot water and other unnecessary opening methods. Save your hands the pain and stress from breaking the factory seal on jars and lids. No need to ask for help with this jar lid opener. Provides the strength and leverage needed to open lids and jars effortlessly. Easy enough for children to use 5-in-1 Bottle Opener: Open any can, jar or bottle with minimum efforts. This bottle jar opener is great for opening bottles that have short tops and are hard to grip. Easily twist off screw caps with a simple twist. Remove a variety of lids from your favorite foods. Very practical and labor-saving. Even children can easily open cans! 4-in-1 Jar opener: Ergonomic designed and easy to use with 4 different jar grips. Multiple jaw size fits most jar/bottle lids or caps. Ensure safety even if your hands are wet, no worries about weak hands or arthritis sufferers, non slip grip and rubber inside grip helps open even the most stubborn jar and bottle lids Non Slip Jar Opener Gripper Pad: Made of high quality food-grade silicone, non-slip, flexible and high resistance that can help you open jar or bottle easily. Features a unique honeycomb design that provide a firm grip even with wet hands, also can be used as a round kitchen coaster, heat insulation mat, place mat, etc. Makes a Perfect Gift: Compact and easy to carry after folded, this ingenious jar and bottle opener makes a great living aid for anyone with low strength. It is also the perfect gift for your family and friends who struggle with jars and bottles opening. Ergonomic & Anti-Slip Design: Ergonomic jar gripper provides the strength and leverage needed to open lids and jars effortlessly, saving your time & energy; Anti-slip PP opener grip for greater safety to protect your hand and fingernails Jar Opener for Weak Hands: Choose the right can gripper opener and place it on the jar lid or bottle cover, turn it around or pull it with the lid opener to open beer, wine, can, soda, wine bottle, metal and plastic bottle caps, jars and remove seals and pull tabs with minimum efforts Jar Opener Gripper Set: You will receive a 5-in-1 bottle opener, a 4-in-1 jar opener and a non slip gripper pad, offering a faster and easier way to open various sealed bottles, cans, jars and containers in kitchen, restaurants, bars, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PyTRH5YqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AUGERSXII","source_asin":"B0BMB51D9M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-785559","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BMB51D9M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BMB51D9M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
