window.products.push({"id":785583,"name":"Electric Salt and Pepper Mill or Spice Grinder Set | Battery Powered One Touch Grind | Set of 2 Mills Kitchen Buddy","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wBlo7ceVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Color:Brushed Stainless Steel/1 Pack  |  Style Name:Set Electric Salt and Pepper Grinder Set (Pack of 2 Mills) - Stainless Steel Construction| Battery Operation| Adjustable Coarseness |LED Light At the press of a button, add freshly ground spices to your dish. Fully automated and equipped with premium parts, these mills are gorgeous, easy to use and are built to last. Other Reasons to Buy the Automatic Electric Salt and Pepper Grinder Set: The automatic electric mills are easy to use and easy to set up. Simply, detach the motor from the grinding base and insert 4 new AA-sized batteries into the top of the motor. Put the two parts back together and the mill is ready to go! This is a set of two identical unlabeled mills. Since the mills are unlabeled, you can use them for salt, pepper, or any of your favorite spices! The transparent glass container lets you see exactly what is in the mill and if the spice needs to be refilled. The stainless steel body makes for a great background if you choose to label the mills with a label maker. Whether you go with a single set or buy multiple sets to store all of your favorite spices, you are sure to love our grinders! We’ve thought of everything, including: Fingerprint-proof, stainless steel grip Ceramic grinder for longevity Knob at the bottom of the grinder to adjust the coarseness of the grind Battery sheath that keeps the batteries from dislodging even if the unit falls or is shaken LED light that makes the set perfect for restaurateurs, home cooks and candlelight dinners Plastic caps for the bottoms of the grinders to keep your table and counters clean","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wBlo7ceVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kitchen Buddy","source_asin":"B07B65MMFM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-785583","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07B65MMFM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07B65MMFM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":785584,"name":"Department 56 Kitschy Klassics Santa Clothes Hanger Hanging Ornament, 5 inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810ClLG-kDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"One Christmas Evening, a group of friends set off to enjoy a dinner of celebration at a small country Inn nestled in a quiet River town. As they rounded a bend in the road, they saw the small, old-fashioned village decorated for the holidays. The lights, like fairies, glowed and sparkled amid the freshly fallen snow. All Evening, the conversation was full of Christmas memories and the visions the tiny town had evoked. Amidst the jovial banter and magical memories, the idea for a lighted Christmas village was born. That spark of an idea became a reality when, in 1976, Department 56 introduced a series of six hand-painted, ceramic buildings. The rest is history. Department 56 knows the importance of celebrating the holidays with family and friends. Savor your time together and make it extra special with Department 56.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810ClLG-kDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Department 56","source_asin":"B01A9A1M2A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-785584","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01A9A1M2A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01A9A1M2A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
