window.products.push({"id":785593,"name":"Pastry Mat for Rolling Dough Non Slip - Non-stick Silicone Baking Mat XLarge - Pastry Sheet for Rolling Out Dough - Dough Mat for Bread Pie Crust/Cook","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-961iG95L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Here’s How You Can Bake Pizza, Biscuits And Bread Like A Professional Chef! Need an extra-durable, easy to use, reusable baking mat, to replace disposable parchment paper and add convenience to your baking? Introducing A High-End Multipurpose Silicone Pastry Mat By HotPick! No need to settle for cheaply-made baking sheets that start peeling right after the first wash, low-quality oven mats that are laden with chemicals and half-sheet baking pads that are too small for your family recipes. The HotPick large, reusable silicone baking sheet is here to help you save time, money and energy on your baking for long years to come! Why Choose Our Reusable Pastry Mat? Here Are The Top 3 Reasons! ✅ BAKE PIZZA, COOKIES & PIES EASIER: Unlike standard pastry sheet liners that slip or cause your baked recipes to stick, our non-stick, non-slip baking mat remains stable on the table or the kitchen countertop, making dough rolling faster. ✅ CLEAN YOUR BAKING MAT IN A BREEZE: Save energy on scrubbing persistent stains from your reusable baking mat! Gently wipe it with soapy water or place it in the dishwasher, to keep it clean and healthy. ✅ USE IT FOR MUCH LONGER: Made of twice as thick silicone as most similar products, our 0.7mm thick pastry mat is uniquely long-lasting. Stop wasting money on flimsy baking pads that start falling peeling after a couple of uses! Need More Reasons? ✔ Extra Heavy-Duty – Heat Resistant To Temperatures -40°F/482°F ✔ Multipurpose – Great As Table Mat, Countertop Mat Or Placemat ✔ 100% Money-Back Guarantee What You Get: 1 * Nonstick Silicone Baking Mat 28x20 (Orange Red) Why Wait? Click “Add To Cart” NOW & Roll Dough Like A Pro Baker!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-961iG95L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HotPick","source_asin":"B07SR5R7HB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-785593","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SR5R7HB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SR5R7HB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":785594,"name":"RNK Shops Sugar Skulls & Flowers Waste Basket - Double Sided (Black) (Personalized)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81L0re9tRxL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Turn your trash can into a charming piece of decor with one of our waste baskets! These custom wastebaskets are the perfect way to add a splash of color and personality to any office, home decor, bathroom, and more! Coordinate it with the decor you already have in your home, or design it with bold patterns so that it may serve as an accent piece in your home!These trash baskets are made of sturdy plastic in a beautiful oval shape that is tapered from the top to the bottom. Each waste paper basket can hold 1.75 gallons, or 7 quarts, and measures approximately 7 by 9 by 11 inches. At this slim size, they are ideal for sliding underneath desks, and also make for wonderful bathroom wastebaskets, as they can easily fit into tighter spaces.You can choose to purchase these decorative wastebaskets in either a white or a black color that will show on the base and the upper rim. Your customization is printed on a high-gloss, fine-quality vinyl adhesive, and you can choose to either have this adhesive applied to one side only or to both sides. As such, this plastic wastebasket can be single-sided or double-sided, depending on your creative vision. Your customization is printed using durable inks, making the design waterproof and resistant to fading over time.Design Shown: Sugar Skulls & Flowers (#272060)Features:==================================== * [Sturdy & Durable]: Made from high-quality plastic for long-lasting use in any space. * [Space-Saving Design]: Slim oval shape and tapered design, perfect for tight spaces and under desks. * [Tailored Appeal]: Choose between single-sided or double-sided full-color printing for a unique touch. * [Versatile Use]: Ideal for home, office, or bathroom with a 1.75-gallon capacity and choice of black or white base.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81L0re9tRxL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RNK Shops","source_asin":"B00ZSAEK30","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-785594","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00ZSAEK30","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00ZSAEK30","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
