window.products.push({"id":785672,"name":"FlySheep 3 Pieces Grey Quilt Set Full Queen Size, Branch with Yellow Flower on Gray, Soft Microfiber Lightweight Summer Bedspread for All Season - 92\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BzLK4bApL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💎 3 PIECE QUILT SET - Includes 1 reversible quilt (92\" x 90\") and 2 shams (20\" x 26\"), No Pillow Insert Includes. Ultra soft microfiber, quilted with high quality 220 GSM fiber, branch with yellow spring flower dots printed on grey, match and enhance your room decor well. Use it in your living room, guest room and vacation room. 💎 ALL SEASON & DURABLE USE - Perfect quilt for warmer weather, you can use it with a top sheet or thin blanket in summer. In chilly weather, layer it with a comforter underneath. The quilt set is made of durable microfiber, allows for long years use. 💎 LIGHTWEIGHT - If you have night sweats, this coverlet is perfect to offer comfortable and breathable sleep. Compared to comforter, coverlet is more lightweight but offers enough warm. It has enough weight to hold its shape, add a classic touch to your room and enhance decor. 💧 MACHINE WASHABLE - Easy to clean, wash in cold water with similar color, tumble dry low and iron when needed, no Bleach. 💎Tips: Color difference may exist due to different display screens! 💎 CUSTOMER SHOPPING EXPERIENCE - Welcome to FlySheep, if you are not satisfied with our product, feel free to contact us at amazon, we will help you within 24 hrs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BzLK4bApL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Flysheep","source_asin":"B094TY7WH4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-785672","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B094TY7WH4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B094TY7WH4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
