window.products.push({"id":785904,"name":"58mm Espresso Coffee Tamper,Premium Barista Espresso Tamper with Calibrated Spring Loaded,Stainless Steel Flat Base for Espresso Machines","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TK1sbLx0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This espresso tamper is designed to fit various sizes of flat bottomless portafilter baskets that have a 58mm diameter. It helps to evenly compress the ground coffee in the portafilter handle, ensuring that the water pressure is consistent during the brewing process. This results in a richer and more flavorful cup of coffee. Compared with the existing calibrated tampers on the market,This product is an improved version of the calibrated tampers includes a circular baffle that helps to ensure that the tamper is pressed down straight, rather than at an angle. This helps to prevent the coffee puck from tilting and ensures a perfectly vertical tamp every time, even when used by different people. The internal spring that helps to control the amount of pressure applied to the ground coffee in the portafilter. It delivers a consistent 30 pounds of pressure every time, resulting in a flat and evenly-packed coffee puck. This can save time and produce a consistently delicious espresso. This tamper is suitable for use by both home baristas and busy cafes. This tamper ensures consistent distribution and pressure on the ground coffee, eliminating key variables in the espresso making process and ensuring even extraction. It will become your go-to accessory for making the perfect espresso. To provide the best shopping experience, we offer a range of sizes for our tampers, including 51mm, 53mm, and 58mm, which are all compatible with various sizes of flat bottomless portafilters. We are confident that we can meet the needs of a diverse customer base and offer a one-year warranty on our products. If you are not satisfied with your purchase at any time, please contact us and we will fully refund your money or, if you prefer, donate the funds to a worthy cause.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TK1sbLx0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JASSY","source_asin":"B0BQ5QKH4X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-785904","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQ5QKH4X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQ5QKH4X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
