window.products.push({"id":785935,"name":"COZCOT Organic Cotton Duvet Cover Cali King, GOTS Certified, Premium 450 Thread Count Soft Sateen Weave, Bottom Ties Closure, Durable and Easy Care (1","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kmubF9LQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% COTTON DUVET COVER. 100% Cotton Sateen Weave Duvet Cover brings the softness and durability to your bed. Surprised by its silky, smooth and soft texture, feels like sleeping on a premium hotel bed. Using high quality selected Long-Staple Cotton yarns, makes it outstanding in Sateen 450 TC sheets. Variable colors available to match with your duvet, comforter in White, Navy Blue, Pink, Olive Green, Magic Grey, Red, Khaki. THE BEST FIT FOR KING OR CALIFORNIA KING SIZE DUVET OR COMFORTER: Our duvet cover features with thick edged hemmed design; luxurious look gives your room a brand-new look. The bottom ties’ design secures your duvets or comforter stay tucked in, and won’t slip away. The 1-piece king, California king duvet cover include 1 duvet cover (110’’ W x 96’’ L). QUALITY CERTIFIED COTTON SHEETS FOR YOUR SAFETY: We source pure organic cotton that is grown naturally without any chemicals or harmful substance. Unlike microfiber and other types of linen, cotton is better for the environment, keeps you warm and cozy, and keeps you comfortable. Moreover, the STANDARD 100 by OEKO-TEX certification, and GOTS certification ensures that our cotton sheets are free from harmful dyes and chemicals, making them safe for you and your family and your kids to use at home. EASY TO CARE: Our top-rated cotton duvet covers are machine washable and don't fade when washed since they are made with the best quality dyes. Additionally, they do not pill or shrink easily. Compared to silk, which require expert maintenance, Sateen sheet is more robust, affordable, and lasting. Give the duvet cover a few washes to achieve its smoothness as cotton softens with washing. We advise washing it first if you are sensitive skin. BUY WITH CONFIDENCE - Our Sateen duvet covers are some of the softest Sateen duvet cover you can find online, they are backed by incredible customer service to make sure your satisfaction is guaranteed. If you don’t like our duvet cover, you can return them for a refund or replacement as per Amazon guidelines, no question asked.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kmubF9LQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COZCOT","source_asin":"B09XDLPZ59","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-785935","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XDLPZ59","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XDLPZ59","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
