window.products.push({"id":785951,"name":"Kate and Laurel Azalea Modern Rose Gold Tinted Frameless Decorative Round Wall Mirror, 26 Inch Diameter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":96.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bJEoL2iRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Create the illusion of space and decorate in contemporary style with this modern frameless wall mirror. It will be the highlight of any room and an essential element in your home decor. This mirror displays flat against the wall to bring in reflective light and space. With its soothing, circular shape, frameless style, classic beveled glass, and contemporary rose gold tint, it's an easy way to revamp an area. Hang it above a fireplace, over an accent table, in a hallway, or use it as a vanity in a bathroom. This mirror is easy to install with hanging hardware already attached to the wooden back for horizontal or vertical wall display. The overall dimensions are 26-inches in diameter by .63-inches deep.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bJEoL2iRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kate and Laurel","source_asin":"B07J5LR4H2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-785951","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07J5LR4H2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07J5LR4H2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":785952,"name":"70th Birthday Water Bottle Labels; Set of 25 Waterproof Water Bottle Wrappers; Gold and White. Happy Birthday Labels","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616GjZgTJIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Easy peel and stick water bottle labels, 8.5\" x 2\", they fit around almost all water bottles, 100% waterproof. Weatherproof stickers, printed in high quality weatherproof paper. Labels fit most standard size water bottles. Waterproof stickers, you can cool down the water bottles in ice without damaging the labels 25 Birthday water bottle labels can be coordinated with minis and kisses stickers in our store.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616GjZgTJIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RokAPary","source_asin":"B07XX9Y6Q7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-785952","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XX9Y6Q7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XX9Y6Q7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":785953,"name":"LEGO Kids' 9001475 Ninjago Kai and Fang-Suei Mini Figure 2 Pack Digital Display Japanese Quartz Alarm Clock","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hg+s6suVL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"Combining the love of Star Wars with the love of LEGOs, the LEGO Midsize Star Wars Luke & Han Solo Watch is the perfect first watch for your young one. This ultra-cool timepiece offers a variety of black and white links to fully customize the durable plastic band. The round, white dial features LEGO-style Luke and Hans ready for action. An outside minute track with clear, white Arabic numbers encircles the interior of the bezel, and rectangular, black hands and a long, white second hand round out the dial. Water resistant to 165 feet (50 meters) and protected by a scratch-resistant mineral crystal, this dependable timepiece will withstand the future battles of your young warrior. LEGO Watches The name \"LEGO\" is an abbreviation of the Danish words \"leg godt,\" meaning \"play well.\" It's our name and our ideal. The LEGO Group was founded in 1932 by Ole Kirk Christiansen. The company has passed from father to son and remains a family-owned business even today, owned by Kjeld Kirk Kristiansen, a grandchild of the founder. It has come a long way over the past decades-from a small carpenter's workshop to a modern, global enterprise. The LEGO Group is a privately held company based in Billund, Denmark. The company is still owned by the Kirk Kristiansen family, who founded it in 1932. The LEGO Group is engaged in the development of children's creativity through playing and learning, and it is this core philosophy that is built into every LEGO brand watch and clock. The masters of spinjitzu are here. LEGO has created these iconic clocks tied to the fantastic LEGO series Ninjago, each clock featuring a detachable weapon. Each clock is fully adjustable and the time is displayed on a digital LCD screen with a backlight so you can easily see it at night. The snooze and backlight functions are activated by pushing down on the mini figures head. See more","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hg+s6suVL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LEGO","source_asin":"B001GIO7GI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-785953","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001GIO7GI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001GIO7GI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":785954,"name":"Joined Cheese Grater with Garlic Crusher - Box Grater Cheese Shredder - Cheese Grater with Handle - Graters for Kitchen Stainless Steel Food Grater - ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YiLzvFgUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Joined Cheese Grater with Garlic Crusher,, Measurements, and Removable Blades, is a convenient and versatile kitchen gadget that will streamline your cooking. It includes 1、3 different grating surfaces, 2、 removable non-slip base 3、2 different measurement units, 4、a thick and comfortable handle 5、a multifunctional vegetable peeler with a julienne blade and potato eye removers. You no longer need separate and messy grating plates and measuring devices; this is a cheese grater with storage container and 2 units of measurement: cups and milliliters. Switching between the coarse, medium, and ﬁne grating surfaces is eﬀortless, with no need for multiple graters. It's also easy to clean with the removable grating surfaces and a cleaning brush included.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81YiLzvFgUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Joined","source_asin":"B0BP7MD6QB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-785954","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BP7MD6QB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BP7MD6QB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":785955,"name":"Waverly Laurel Springs Modern Farmhouse Floral 4-Piece Reversible Comforter Set, King, Parchment","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":143.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DR0rYNfxL._AC_.jpg","description":"Transform any bedroom into an exotic garden oasis with the Laurel Springs bedding collection. The traditional leafy vine, floral and coordinating stripe design come to life in rich jewel tones of crimson red, green, blue, and gold with contrasting cream accents on a natural ground. Fluttering butterflies and busy dragonflies add flair and visual interest to the beautiful floral design. The bold patterns, bright accents and decorative motifs, offer an elegant and majestic update to any bedroom decor. Each reversible comforter is crafted of woven, 100% cotton jacquard, creating just the right blend for visual interest and surface texture. Woven jacquard offers an all-over leaf design to compliment the bold floral print. Stripe on the comforter reverse and tri-colored, decorative braided ribbon adds a luxurious finish to the comforter and shams. The 5-box pleat bed skirt construction offers sophistication and visual interest for a more tailored, designer look. Queen comforter set features a 92” x 96” reversible comforter, two 21” x 26” standard shams, and a 60” x 80” tailored bedskirt with 15” drop. King comforter set includes a 110” x 96” reversible comforter, two 21” x 36” king shams, and a 78” x 80” tailored bedskirt with 15” drop. The comforter, shams and bed skirt are machine washable for easy-care. Wash in cold water on the gentle cycle and tumble dry on low for optimal care and long lasting beauty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DR0rYNfxL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WAVERLY","source_asin":"B01DK8PJCC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-785955","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01DK8PJCC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01DK8PJCC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
